{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Mr. Pompy's Extravagant Quiz! The only quiz to outbeat your brain!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Extravagant Quiz!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Mr. Pompy's Extravagant Quiz, a narrative horror experience taking place in an early 2000s edutainment computer game. Your mission: solve Mr. Pompy's quizzes to recover the lost golden light bulbs, all while he attempts to speak to you beyond the screen. <strong>This is a tech demo, with the full game coming soon!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How It Started</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations! You're among the few people who received our unique cereal box copies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>*NOTE: Any future giveaways of this game are to be discontinued indefinitely. Any customers to get their hands on a copy are considered a lost cause.</i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/case_send_2.gif?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the Crew! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You've got PomPom!</strong> Her lively and boisterous personality can help you solve math problems and, all in all, lift your mood. Visit her store occasionally to purchase several treats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/pompom_card.png?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Next is Patrick!</strong> He will speed you through all you need to know about history and science. Perhaps even to the extent where you greatly surpass him. Visit his library whenever you have some free time to learn about interesting topics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/patrick_card.png?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Finally, we have Mr. Pompy himself!</strong> As your host, he will ensure that you win the game with nothing less than  perfection and a more positive attitude towards life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/pompy_card.gif?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzles &amp; Quizzes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do puzzles to proceed to the quiz: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/game_prev_3.gif?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your smarts with our amazing quizzes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/game_prev_4.gif?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how well you did:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/game_prev_5.gif?t=1752443590\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Brought to you by Light Thoughts Game Company. Discover the light within your mind.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998260/f4d90808ee3d738c62a061ae35028ecd13242d21.jpg"},{"name":"Trivia Goodness!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998260/fcd613790be0e3051d3c788e5ff18f57d2754ecc.jpg"},{"name":"Are you dumb?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998260/59e21675774b174082f1e9dc43da8b4bfda95247.jpg"},{"name":"Wel